Title sdl2quake
Version 1.0
Description Quake for OPENSTEP 4.2 on Intel i486: squake (software renderer, AppKit window) and glquake (hardware, drawn by a Matrox G450 through the OpenStepMGA driver's accelerated Mesa -- requires OSMGADisplay 1.3+ with VRAM Mmap and Mesa Acceleration set to Yes). Both statically linked; no libraries are installed. Game data is NOT included: install sdl2quake-libre at the same place, or provide your own id1 directory.
DefaultLocation /usr/local/quake
Relocatable YES
Application NO
UseUserMask NO
DiskName SDL2 Quake OPENSTEP Intel
DeleteWarning Removing this package removes the two engine binaries and their documentation. The game data package beside them is untouched.
